@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> Enter Query : User starts search
Enter Query --> Process Search : Enter query
Process Search --> Retrieve Results : Process search
Retrieve Results --> View Results : Retrieve results
View Results --> Filter Results : Filter results
Filter Results --> Retrieve Results : Apply filters
View Results --> Save Results : Save results
Save Results --> View Results : Results saved
View Results --> Refine Search : Refine search
Refine Search --> Process Search : Process refined search
View Results --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
